          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pikkupstix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pikkupstix</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pikkupstix%27s_Summoning_Shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">his summoning shop</a> just north-west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Taverley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Taverley</a>&#39;s east entrance.",
